Description: 3D printer slicer by ELEGOO (based on OrcaSlicer)
 ElegooSlicer converts 3D models (STL, 3MF, STEP, OBJ, ...) into G-code for
 FDM 3D printers. It is based on OrcaSlicer and ships printer, filament and
 process profiles for ELEGOO printers.
 .
 This is an unofficial build of the upstream release, installed into
 /opt/elegoo-slicer. ELEGOO cloud features are disabled because they depend
 on a proprietary SDK; printing over the local network works.
